        </p>
      </a>
      <a href="/docs/architecture/exec-tiers/" class="group rounded-2xl border border-[var(--tb-c-divider)] p-6 transition-colors hover:border-[var(--tb-c-accent)]" style="background: var(--tb-c-bg-soft);">
